-- TIÊU CHÍ v2 sau lượt chấm thử 6 creative (25/10/2026): thẻ cuối chuẩn "WHAT HAPPENS NEXT?" / "¿QUÉ PASA DESPUÉS?" + nút WATCH FREE · LEARN MORE
-- là khuôn đang chạy từ 22/10 (máy trừ điểm oan); lời chép giọng có thể lặp ảo (ASR) — không tính là lỗi tiếng / dụ nhấp.
UPDATE etp.tieu_chi SET mo_ta = 'The end card must use the standard template: poster + drama title + the headline question "WHAT HAPPENS NEXT?" / "¿QUÉ PASA DESPUÉS?" + one button reading exactly "WATCH FREE · LEARN MORE" / "MÍRALA GRATIS · MÁS INFORMACIÓN" — this template is ALLOWED, score it 10. Deduct only for: Tap / Click / Toca, arrows, pointing hands or icons, countdowns, "limited time", FREE / GRATIS badges, or any extra CTA text.' WHERE nhom = 'afs' AND ma = 'cta';
UPDATE etp.tieu_chi SET mo_ta = 'No click-bait or pressure to click: no fake buttons, fake system notifications or play icons, no voice urging to tap or click, no exaggerated urgency. The standard end-card question "WHAT HAPPENS NEXT?" is allowed. Repeated words in the voice transcript are speech-recognition artifacts, not urging.' WHERE nhom = 'afs' AND ma = 'du_nhap';
UPDATE etp.tieu_chi SET mo_ta = 'Clean production: no leftover overlays / watermarks / buttons from the source app, no broken or frozen frames, text readable. Judge video frames only — the voice transcript is machine speech recognition and may repeat phrases by mistake; never deduct for that.' WHERE nhom = 'afs' AND ma = 'chat_luong';
